Attack with your offhand weapon for [105%, 120%, 131%, 141%, 150% (TL1-5)] damage. If the attack hits, the target is stunned for [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] turns, and you hit it with your mainhand weapon doing [105%, 120%, 131%, 141%, 150% (TL1-5)] damage.

The stun chance increases with your Accuracy.
